[
    {
        "id": "ex06-tab",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "SITL 01 Completion takeoff",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Arm (confirm ACK) \u2192 Takeoff with completion-tier await on ArduPilot SITL sysid 1. Requires ArduPilot Copter SITL at 127.0.0.1:14551. The takeoff node uses delivery=complete which waits for IN_PROGRESS then ACCEPTED, distinguishing a real climb from a premature accept.",
        "env": []
    },
    {
        "id": "ex06-comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "ex06-tab",
        "name": "Arm then takeoff (completion tier against ArduPilot Copter SITL)",
        "info": "This flow targets sysid 1 (first ArduPilot SITL). Set completionTimeout to at least 30 s; ArduPilot typically sends IN_PROGRESS within 2 s then ACCEPTED once the vehicle is airborne.\n\nDelivery=complete blocks output 0 until the completion-tier ACCEPTED arrives. A timeout on output 1 means the vehicle accepted the command but never reached the target altitude (or the link was lost).\n\nConnection: bind 0.0.0.0:14550, remote 127.0.0.1:14551 for a local Copter SITL started with\n  sim_vehicle.py -v ArduCopter --out udp:127.0.0.1:14550",
        "x": 230,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
